-- title:
--   Full original compensated H simultaneous indexed BV sources equal genuine stopped physical finite jump-cell sums
-- statement:
--   For the actual original BV spectrally negative Lévy process and original admissible dividend strategy, a natural-number family of compact interior C1 bands with genuine explicit Lipschitz and bounded-value estimates has one original full-probability sample-path event on which every original full H source integral on the global original marked Lévy NX equals its exactly corresponding signed finite stopped physical-grid jump-cell sums for every band index, finite horizon and grid size. This is the source-exact combination of the already Proved original unconditional full H same-grid real integral theorem and pinned Mathlib ae_all_iff, preserving the genuine original left reserve, original time-zero exclusion and final ruin/horizon contact on every index, with no stochastic surrogate, assumed source identity or integrability condition.

